{"id":"espi_ritu","lemma":"espíritu","pos":"noun","rank":951,"glosses":["spirit, soul","mind"],"ipa":"/esˈpiɾitu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"espíritus"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-esp%C3%ADritu.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ese es el espíritu.","en":"That's the spirit.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Él puede hablar con los espíritus.","en":"He can talk to spirits.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to talk"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Ella parece poseída por un espíritu maligno.","en":"She seems to be possessed by an evil spirit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706524","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"possessed","l":"poseído"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"malicious, malevolent"}]},{"text":"Un espíritu alegre es más valioso que un gran sueldo.","en":"A happy spirit is worth more than a hefty salary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704709","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"joyful, cheerful"},null,null,{"g":"valuable"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"salary, wage"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"furthermore"]]}]}